mporteren</span></a></li></ul></nav>
    <div class="llbh-content">
      <article class="llbh-art" id="h-start"><header class="llbh-art-h"><div class="llbh-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 4h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v12a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"/><path d="M22 4h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v12a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"/></svg></div><div class="llbh-art-t"><h2><span data-lang="en">Getting started</span><span data-lang="nl">Aan de slag</span></h2><p><span data-lang="en">Theme Options is the control panel of the theme. You find it in the dashboard menu on the left.</span><span data-lang="nl">Theme Options is het bedieningspaneel van het thema. U vindt het links in het menu van het dashboard.</span></p></div></header><div class="llbh-art-b"><h3><span data-lang="en">How to use it</span><span data-lang="nl">Zo gebruikt u het</span></h3><ol class="llbh-steps" data-lang="en"><li>Go to <b>Dashboard → Theme Options</b>.</li><li>Choose a section in the menu on the left (on a phone: at the top).</li><li>Change a switch or a field. A bar appears at the bottom: <b>You have unsaved changes</b>.</li><li>Click <b>Save changes</b>. The change is live right away — the cache is cleared automatically.</li></ol><ol class="llbh-steps" data-lang="nl"><li>Ga naar <b>Dashboard → Theme Options</b>.</li><li>Kies links een onderdeel in het menu (op een telefoon: bovenaan).</li><li>Wijzig een schakelaar of een veld. Onderaan verschijnt een balk: <b>You have unsaved changes</b>.</li><li>Klik op <b>Save changes</b>. De wijziging staat direct online — de cache wordt automatisch geleegd.</li></ol><div class="llbh-note llbh-note--info"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg><p><span data-lang="en">Changed your mind? Click <b>Discard</b> in the bottom bar to undo all unsaved changes.</span><span data-lang="nl">Toch niet? Klik op <b>Discard</b> in de balk onderaan om alle niet-opgeslagen wijzigingen ongedaan te maken.</span></p></div></div></article>
      <article class="llbh-art" id="h-overview"><header class="llbh-art-h"><div class="llbh-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/></svg></div><div class="llbh-art-t"><h2><span data-lang="en">Overview</span><span data-lang="nl">Overzicht</span></h2><p><span data-lang="en">The start screen of Theme Options: the status of every feature at a glance.</span><span data-lang="nl">Het startscherm van Theme Options: de status van elke functie in één oogopslag.</span></p></div><a class="llbh-open" href="<?php echo esc_url( admin_url( 'admin.php?page=llb-theme-options#overview' ) ); ?>"><span data-lang="en">Open in Theme Options</span><span data-lang="nl">Openen in Theme Options</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></header><div class="llbh-art-b"><figure class="llbh-shot"><a href="<?php echo esc_url( llb_asset( 'images/help/help-overview.webp' ) ); ?>" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( llb_asset( 'images/help/help-overview.webp' ) ); ?>" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><figcaption><span data-lang="en">Screenshot — click to enlarge</span><span data-lang="nl">Schermafbeelding — klik om te vergroten</span></figcaption></figure><h3><span data-lang="en">What each setting does</span><span data-lang="nl">Wat elke instelling doet</span></h3><dl class="llbh-set"><div><dt>Status cards</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">Three dark cards at the top: how many features are on, whether the website is <b>Live</b> or in <b>Maintenance</b> (red), and the theme version.</span><span data-lang="nl">Drie donkere kaarten bovenaan: hoeveel functies aan staan, of de website <b>Live</b> is of in <b>Maintenance</b> (rood), en de versie van het thema.</span></dd></div><div><dt>Feature cards</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">One card per feature with a switch. Turn a feature on or off right here.</span><span data-lang="nl">Eén kaart per functie met een schakelaar. Zet een functie hier direct aan of uit.</span></dd></div><div><dt>Settings →</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">Opens the section with all settings of that feature.</span><span data-lang="nl">Opent het onderdeel met alle instellingen van die functie.</span></dd></div></dl><h3><span data-lang="en">How to use it</span><span data-lang="nl">Zo gebruikt u het</span></h3><ol class="llbh-steps" data-lang="en"><li>Open <b>Theme Options</b> — the Overview opens first.</li><li>Use a switch to turn a feature on or off.</li><li>Click <b>Save changes</b>.</li></ol><ol class="llbh-steps" data-lang="nl"><li>Open <b>Theme Options</b> — het Overzicht opent als eerste.</li><li>Zet een functie aan of uit met de schakelaar.</li><li>Klik op <b>Save changes</b>.</li></ol></div></article><article class="llbh-art" id="h-general"><header class="llbh-art-h"><div class="llbh-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 6h10M18 6h2M4 12h4M12 12h8M4 18h12M20 18h0"/><circle cx="16" cy="6" r="2"/><circle cx="10" cy="12" r="2"/><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="2"/></svg></div><div class="llbh-art-t"><h2><span data-lang="en">General</span><span data-lang="nl">Algemeen</span></h2><p><span data-lang="en">Effects and sections that apply to the whole website.</span><span data-lang="nl">Effecten en onderdelen die voor de hele website gelden.</span></p></div><a class="llbh-open" href="<?php echo esc_url( admin_url( 'admin.php?page=llb-theme-options#general' ) ); ?>"><span data-lang="en">Open in Theme Options</span><span data-lang="nl">Openen in Theme Options</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></header><div class="llbh-art-b"><figure class="llbh-shot"><a href="<?php echo esc_url( llb_asset( 'images/help/help-general.webp' ) ); ?>" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( llb_asset( 'images/help/help-general.webp' ) ); ?>" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><figcaption><span data-lang="en">Screenshot — click to enlarge</span><span data-lang="nl">Schermafbeelding — klik om te vergroten</span></figcaption></figure><h3><span data-lang="en">What each setting does</span><span data-lang="nl">Wat elke instelling doet</span></h3><dl class="llbh-set"><div><dt>Animations</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">Motion effects on the whole website: elements that fade in while scrolling, images that reveal, zoom on hover. Turn it off for a calm, static website.</span><span data-lang="nl">Bewegingseffecten op de hele website: elementen die invloeien tijdens het scrollen, afbeeldingen die verschijnen, zoom bij aanwijzen. Zet het uit voor een rustige, statische website.</span></dd></div><div><dt>Projects</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">Shows everything related to projects. When off, the projects page, the project sections and the menu links are hidden. Project pages show a “page not found” (404) to visitors and are removed from the sitemap. <b>Nothing is deleted</b> — turn it on again and everything is back.</span><span data-lang="nl">Toont alles wat met projecten te maken heeft. Staat het uit, dan worden de projectenpagina, de projectonderdelen en de menulinks verborgen. Projectpagina’s tonen bezoekers een “pagina niet gevonden” (404) en verdwijnen uit de sitemap. <b>Er wordt niets verwijderd</b> — zet het weer aan en alles is terug.</span></dd></div><div><dt>Back to top button</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">A round button in the bottom-right corner that appears after scrolling down. One click brings the visitor back to the top.</span><span data-lang="nl">Een ronde knop rechtsonder die verschijnt na het naar beneden scrollen. Eén klik brengt de bezoeker terug naar boven.</span></dd></div></dl><h3><span data-lang="en">How to use it</span><span data-lang="nl">Zo gebruikt u het</span></h3><ol class="llbh-steps" data-lang="en"><li>Go to <b>Theme Options → General</b>.</li><li>Turn a switch on or off.</li><li>Click <b>Save changes</b> and check the website.</li></ol><ol class="llbh-steps" data-lang="nl"><li>Ga naar <b>Theme Options → General</b>.</li><li>Zet een schakelaar aan of uit.</li><li>Klik op <b>Save changes</b> en bekijk de website.</li></ol><div class="llbh-note llbh-note--info"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg><p><span data-lang="en">Use <b>Projects: off</b> when you do not have real projects to show yet. Administrators can still open the project pages, with a notice at the top.</span><span data-lang="nl">Gebruik <b>Projects: uit</b> zolang u nog geen echte projecten heeft om te tonen. Beheerders kunnen de projectpagina’s nog wel openen, met een melding bovenaan.</span></p></div></div></article><article class="llbh-art" id="h-contact"><header class="llbh-art-h"><div class="llbh-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 12a8 8 0 0 1-11.6 7.1L4 20l1-4.6A8 8 0 1 1 21 12z"/></svg></div><div class="llbh-art-t"><h2><span data-lang="en">Contact buttons</span><span data-lang="nl">Contactknoppen</span></h2><p><span data-lang="en">Quick ways for visitors to reach the company.</span><span data-lang="nl">Snelle manieren waarop bezoekers het bedrijf kunnen bereiken.</span></p></div><a class="llbh-open" href="<?php echo esc_url( admin_url( 'admin.php?page=llb-theme-options#contact' ) ); ?>"><span data-lang="en">Open in Theme Options</span><span data-lang="nl">Openen in Theme Options</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></header><div class="llbh-art-b"><figure class="llbh-shot"><a href="<?php echo esc_url( llb_asset( 'images/help/help-contact.webp' ) ); ?>" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( llb_asset( 'images/help/help-contact.webp' ) ); ?>" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><figcaption><span data-lang="en">Screenshot — click to enlarge</span><span data-lang="nl">Schermafbeelding — klik om te vergroten</span></figcaption></figure><h3><span data-lang="en">What each setting does</span><span data-lang="nl">Wat elke instelling doet</span></h3><dl class="llbh-set"><div><dt>WhatsApp button</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">A round WhatsApp button in the bottom-right corner on every page. A tap opens WhatsApp with your number and a ready-made message.</span><span data-lang="nl">Een ronde WhatsApp-knop rechtsonder op elke pagina. Eén tik opent WhatsApp met uw nummer en een kant-en-klaar bericht.</span></dd></div><div><dt>WhatsApp number</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">Your number in international format, for example <code>+31612345678</code>. When this field is empty, the button is hidden.</span><span data-lang="nl">Uw nummer in internationaal formaat, bijvoorbeeld <code>+31612345678</code>. Is dit veld leeg, dan wordt de knop verborgen.</span></dd></div><div><dt>Pre-filled message</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">The text the visitor sees in WhatsApp before sending. Write it in the language of the website.</span><span data-lang="nl">De tekst die de bezoeker in WhatsApp ziet voordat hij verstuurt. Schrijf die in de taal van de website.</span></dd></div><div><dt>Mobile contact bar</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">A fixed bar at the bottom of the screen, <b>on phones only</b>, with a call button and a quote button.</span><span data-lang="nl">Een vaste balk onderaan het scherm, <b>alleen op telefoons</b>, met een belknop en een offerteknop.</span></dd></div><div><dt>Button texts</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">The texts of the two buttons. The call button uses the phone number from <b>Appearance → Customize → Company & contact</b>. The quote button opens the contact page.</span><span data-lang="nl">De teksten van de twee knoppen. De belknop gebruikt het telefoonnummer uit <b>Weergave → Customizer → Company & contact</b>. De offerteknop opent de contactpagina.</span></dd></div></dl><h3><span data-lang="en">How to use it</span><span data-lang="nl">Zo gebruikt u het</span></h3><ol class="llbh-steps" data-lang="en"><li>Go to <b>Theme Options → Contact buttons</b>.</li><li>Turn on <b>WhatsApp button</b> and/or <b>Mobile contact bar</b>. The fields appear below the switch.</li><li>Fill in the number and the texts.</li><li>Click <b>Save changes</b> and test it on your phone.</li></ol><ol class="llbh-steps" data-lang="nl"><li>Ga naar <b>Theme Options → Contact buttons</b>.</li><li>Zet <b>WhatsApp button</b> en/of <b>Mobile contact bar</b> aan. De velden verschijnen onder de schakelaar.</li><li>Vul het nummer en de teksten in.</li><li>Klik op <b>Save changes</b> en test het op uw telefoon.</li></ol><div class="llbh-note llbh-note--warn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.3 3.9 1.8 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h17a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0z"/><path d="M12 9v4M12 17h.01"/></svg><p><span data-lang="en">Check the phone number in the Customizer first. Without a phone number the call button cannot work.</span><span data-lang="nl">Controleer eerst het telefoonnummer in de Customizer. Zonder telefoonnummer werkt de belknop niet.</span></p></div></div></article><article class="llbh-art" id="h-social"><header class="llbh-art-h"><div class="llbh-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="18" cy="5" r="3"/><circle cx="6" cy="12" r="3"/><circle cx="18" cy="19" r="3"/><path d="M8.6 13.5l6.8 4M15.4 6.5l-6.8 4"/></svg></div><div class="llbh-art-t"><h2><span data-lang="en">Social media</span><span data-lang="nl">Social media</span></h2><p><span data-lang="en">The company profiles on social media, shown as round icons.</span><span data-lang="nl">De bedrijfsprofielen op social media, getoond als ronde iconen.</span></p></div><a class="llbh-open" href="<?php echo esc_url( admin_url( 'admin.php?page=llb-theme-options#social' ) ); ?>"><span data-lang="en">Open in Theme Options</span><span data-lang="nl">Openen in Theme Options</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></header><div class="llbh-art-b"><figure class="llbh-shot"><a href="<?php echo esc_url( llb_asset( 'images/help/help-social.webp' ) ); ?>" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( llb_asset( 'images/help/help-social.webp' ) ); ?>" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><figcaption><span data-lang="en">Screenshot — click to enlarge</span><span data-lang="nl">Schermafbeelding — klik om te vergroten</span></figcaption></figure><h3><span data-lang="en">What each setting does</span><span data-lang="nl">Wat elke instelling doet</span></h3><dl class="llbh-set"><div><dt>Profiles</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">Instagram, Facebook, LinkedIn, YouTube and Google Business. Paste the full link of each profile. <b>Leave a field empty to hide that icon.</b></span><span data-lang="nl">Instagram, Facebook, LinkedIn, YouTube en Google Business. Plak de volledige link van elk profiel. <b>Laat een veld leeg om dat icoon te verbergen.</b></span></dd></div><div><dt>Where to show the icons</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">Choose the places: <b>Footer</b> (the standard place), <b>Contact page</b> and <b>Phone menu</b>. A black chip means: shown.</span><span data-lang="nl">Kies de plekken: <b>Footer</b> (de standaardplek), <b>Contactpagina</b> en <b>Telefoonmenu</b>. Een zwarte knop betekent: zichtbaar.</span></dd></div><div><dt>Preview</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">Shows how the icons look in the footer.</span><span data-lang="nl">Toont hoe de iconen er in de footer uitzien.</span></dd></div></dl><h3><span data-lang="en">How to use it</span><span data-lang="nl">Zo gebruikt u het</span></h3><ol class="llbh-steps" data-lang="en"><li>Go to <b>Theme Options → Social media</b>.</li><li>Paste the link of each profile, starting with <code>https://</code>.</li><li>Choose where the icons appear.</li><li>Click <b>Save changes</b>.</li></ol><ol class="llbh-steps" data-lang="nl"><li>Ga naar <b>Theme Options → Social media</b>.</li><li>Plak de link van elk profiel, beginnend met <code>https://</code>.</li><li>Kies waar de iconen verschijnen.</li><li>Klik op <b>Save changes</b>.</li></ol><div class="llbh-note llbh-note--info"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg><p><span data-lang="en">Best practice: 3 to 5 active profiles. Only add profiles you really keep up to date.</span><span data-lang="nl">Advies: 3 tot 5 actieve profielen. Voeg alleen profielen toe die u echt bijhoudt.</span></p></div></div></article><article class="llbh-art" id="h-seo"><header class="llbh-art-h"><div class="llbh-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="M20 20l-3.5-3.5"/></svg></div><div class="llbh-art-t"><h2><span data-lang="en">SEO</span><span data-lang="nl">SEO</span></h2><p><span data-lang="en">Helps Google understand the company and the structure of the pages.</span><span data-lang="nl">Helpt Google het bedrijf en de opbouw van de pagina’s te begrijpen.</span></p></div><a class="llbh-open" href="<?php echo esc_url( admin_url( 'admin.php?page=llb-theme-options#seo' ) ); ?>"><span data-lang="en">Open in Theme Options</span><span data-lang="nl">Openen in Theme Options</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></header><div class="llbh-art-b"><figure class="llbh-shot"><a href="<?php echo esc_url( llb_asset( 'images/help/help-seo.webp' ) ); ?>" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( llb_asset( 'images/help/help-seo.webp' ) ); ?>" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><figcaption><span data-lang="en">Screenshot — click to enlarge</span><span data-lang="nl">Schermafbeelding — klik om te vergroten</span></figcaption></figure><h3><span data-lang="en">What each setting does</span><span data-lang="nl">Wat elke instelling doet</span></h3><dl class="llbh-set"><div><dt>Local business data</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">Adds hidden company data for Google (type <code>GeneralContractor</code>): name, address, phone, opening hours and social profiles. Important for local search results and Google Maps. The data comes from <b>Appearance → Customize</b>.</span><span data-lang="nl">Voegt verborgen bedrijfsgegevens voor Google toe (type <code>GeneralContractor</code>): naam, adres, telefoon, openingstijden en socialmediaprofielen. Belangrijk voor lokale zoekresultaten en Google Maps. De gegevens komen uit <b>Weergave → Customizer</b>.</span></dd></div><div><dt>Area served</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">The region where the company works, for example the city and surroundings. Write it in the language of the website.</span><span data-lang="nl">Het gebied waar het bedrijf werkt, bijvoorbeeld de stad en omgeving. Schrijf dit in de taal van de website.</span></dd></div><div><dt>Breadcrumbs</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">A small trail above the page title (for example <i>Home / Services / Tiling</i>) on every page except the homepage. Visitors see where they are, Google understands the structure.</span><span data-lang="nl">Een klein pad boven de paginatitel (bijvoorbeeld <i>Home / Diensten / Tegelwerk</i>) op elke pagina behalve de homepage. Bezoekers zien waar ze zijn, Google begrijpt de structuur.</span></dd></div></dl><h3><span data-lang="en">How to use it</span><span data-lang="nl">Zo gebruikt u het</span></h3><ol class="llbh-steps" data-lang="en"><li>Go to <b>Theme Options → SEO</b>.</li><li>Keep both switches on (recommended).</li><li>Check <b>Area served</b>.</li><li>Click <b>Save changes</b>.</li></ol><ol class="llbh-steps" data-lang="nl"><li>Ga naar <b>Theme Options → SEO</b>.</li><li>Laat beide schakelaars aan staan (aanbevolen).</li><li>Controleer <b>Area served</b>.</li><li>Klik op <b>Save changes</b>.</li></ol><div class="llbh-note llbh-note--info"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg><p><span data-lang="en">Is <b>Yoast SEO</b> or <b>Rank Math</b> active? Then that plugin makes the breadcrumbs and the theme only adds the styling. A note at the top of this section tells you which one is used.</span><span data-lang="nl">Is <b>Yoast SEO</b> of <b>Rank Math</b> actief? Dan maakt die plugin de breadcrumbs en zorgt het thema alleen voor de opmaak. Een melding bovenaan dit onderdeel laat zien welke wordt gebruikt.</span></p></div></div></article><article class="llbh-art" id="h-maint"><header class="llbh-art-h"><div class="llbh-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.7 6.3a4 4 0 0 0-5.4 5.4L3 18v3h3l6.3-6.3a4 4 0 0 0 5.4-5.4l-2.5 2.5-2.4-.6-.6-2.4z"/></svg></div><div class="llbh-art-t"><h2><span data-lang="en">Maintenance</span><span data-lang="nl">Onderhoud</span></h2><p><span data-lang="en">Shows a holding page to visitors while you work on the website.</span><span data-lang="nl">Toont bezoekers een tijdelijke pagina terwijl u aan de website werkt.</span></p></div><a class="llbh-open" href="<?php echo esc_url( admin_url( 'admin.php?page=llb-theme-options#maint' ) ); ?>"><span data-lang="en">Open in Theme Options</span><span data-lang="nl">Openen in Theme Options</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></header><div class="llbh-art-b"><figure class="llbh-shot"><a href="<?php echo esc_url( llb_asset( 'images/help/help-maint.webp' ) ); ?>" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( llb_asset( 'images/help/help-maint.webp' ) ); ?>" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><figcaption><span data-lang="en">Screenshot — click to enlarge</span><span data-lang="nl">Schermafbeelding — klik om te vergroten</span></figcaption></figure><h3><span data-lang="en">What each setting does</span><span data-lang="nl">Wat elke instelling doet</span></h3><dl class="llbh-set"><div><dt>Maintenance mode</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">Visitors see a holding page in the style of the website. Google is told the site is temporarily unavailable, so <b>rankings are not harmed</b>. Logged-in administrators always see the normal website.</span><span data-lang="nl">Bezoekers zien een tijdelijke pagina in de stijl van de website. Google krijgt te horen dat de site tijdelijk niet beschikbaar is, dus <b>de posities in Google blijven behouden</b>. Ingelogde beheerders zien altijd de normale website.</span></dd></div><div><dt>Heading & Text</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">The title and text on the holding page. Logo, phone and e-mail are added automatically.</span><span data-lang="nl">De titel en tekst op de tijdelijke pagina. Logo, telefoon en e-mail worden automatisch toegevoegd.</span></dd></div><div><dt>Client preview link</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">A secret link to share with someone without an account. Whoever opens it sees the real website for <b>7 days</b>. Click <b>Copy</b> to copy it.</span><span data-lang="nl">Een geheime link om te delen met iemand zonder account. Wie de link opent, ziet de echte website <b>7 dagen</b> lang. Klik op <b>Copy</b> om hem te kopiëren.</span></dd></div><div><dt>New link</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">Makes a new preview link. <b>The old link stops working immediately.</b></span><span data-lang="nl">Maakt een nieuwe voorbeeldlink. <b>De oude link werkt direct niet meer.</b></span></dd></div></dl><h3><span data-lang="en">How to use it</span><span data-lang="nl">Zo gebruikt u het</span></h3><ol class="llbh-steps" data-lang="en"><li>Go to <b>Theme Options → Maintenance</b>.</li><li>Turn on <b>Maintenance mode</b> and check the heading and text.</li><li>Click <b>Save changes</b>. The status card on the Overview turns red.</li><li>Want someone to see the website? Copy the <b>Client preview link</b> and send it.</li><li>Finished? Turn maintenance mode off and save.</li></ol><ol class="llbh-steps" data-lang="nl"><li>Ga naar <b>Theme Options → Maintenance</b>.</li><li>Zet <b>Maintenance mode</b> aan en controleer de titel en tekst.</li><li>Klik op <b>Save changes</b>. De statuskaart op het Overzicht wordt rood.</li><li>Wilt u dat iemand de website bekijkt? Kopieer de <b>Client preview link</b> en stuur die door.</li><li>Klaar? Zet de onderhoudsmodus uit en sla op.</li></ol><div class="llbh-note llbh-note--warn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.3 3.9 1.8 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h17a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0z"/><path d="M12 9v4M12 17h.01"/></svg><p><span data-lang="en">To see the holding page yourself, open the website in a private window (you are logged in, so you see the normal website).</span><span data-lang="nl">Wilt u de tijdelijke pagina zelf zien? Open de website in een privévenster (u bent ingelogd en ziet dus de normale website).</span></p></div><div class="llbh-note llbh-note--warn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.3 3.9 1.8 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h17a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0z"/><path d="M12 9v4M12 17h.01"/></svg><p><span data-lang="en">Do not forget to turn maintenance mode off when the website is ready.</span><span data-lang="nl">Vergeet niet de onderhoudsmodus uit te zetten zodra de website klaar is.</span></p></div></div></article><article class="llbh-art" id="h-ann"><header class="llbh-art-h"><div class="llbh-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 11v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2l5 4V6L6 10H4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1zM15 9a3 3 0 0 1 0 6M18 6a7 7 0 0 1 0 12"/></svg></div><div class="llbh-art-t"><h2><span data-lang="en">Announcement</span><span data-lang="nl">Mededeling</span></h2><p><span data-lang="en">A thin bar above the header for short news, like holiday closing days.</span><span data-lang="nl">Een smalle balk boven de header voor kort nieuws, zoals sluitingsdagen in de vakantie.</span></p></div><a class="llbh-open" href="<?php echo esc_url( admin_url( 'admin.php?page=llb-theme-options#ann' ) ); ?>"><span data-lang="en">Open in Theme Options</span><span data-lang="nl">Openen in Theme Options</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></header><div class="llbh-art-b"><figure class="llbh-shot"><a href="<?php echo esc_url( llb_asset( 'images/help/help-ann.webp' ) ); ?>" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( llb_asset( 'images/help/help-ann.webp' ) ); ?>" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><figcaption><span data-lang="en">Screenshot — click to enlarge</span><span data-lang="nl">Schermafbeelding — klik om te vergroten</span></figcaption></figure><h3><span data-lang="en">What each setting does</span><span data-lang="nl">Wat elke instelling doet</span></h3><dl class="llbh-set"><div><dt>Announcement bar</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">Turns the bar on or off. Visitors can close it with the ×; the website remembers this for that message.</span><span data-lang="nl">Zet de balk aan of uit. Bezoekers kunnen hem sluiten met het ×; de website onthoudt dit voor dat bericht.</span></dd></div><div><dt>Text</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">The short message, one sentence.</span><span data-lang="nl">Het korte bericht, één zin.</span></dd></div><div><dt>Link (optional)</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">A link with its own text, for example “Read more”. Leave empty for no link.</span><span data-lang="nl">Een link met een eigen tekst, bijvoorbeeld “Lees meer”. Laat leeg voor geen link.</span></dd></div><div><dt>Show between (optional)</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">A start and end date. The bar only shows in that period. Leave empty to show it all the time.</span><span data-lang="nl">Een begin- en einddatum. De balk is alleen in die periode zichtbaar. Laat leeg om hem altijd te tonen.</span></dd></div></dl><h3><span data-lang="en">How to use it</span><span data-lang="nl">Zo gebruikt u het</span></h3><ol class="llbh-steps" data-lang="en"><li>Go to <b>Theme Options → Announcement</b>.</li><li>Turn on <b>Announcement bar</b> and write the text.</li><li>Optional: add a link and dates.</li><li>Click <b>Save changes</b>.</li></ol><ol class="llbh-steps" data-lang="nl"><li>Ga naar <b>Theme Options → Announcement</b>.</li><li>Zet <b>Announcement bar</b> aan en schrijf de tekst.</li><li>Optioneel: voeg een link en data toe.</li><li>Klik op <b>Save changes</b>.</li></ol><div class="llbh-note llbh-note--info"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg><p><span data-lang="en">Changed the text? The bar shows again for everyone, also for visitors who closed the old message.</span><span data-lang="nl">Tekst gewijzigd? Dan verschijnt de balk weer voor iedereen, ook voor bezoekers die het oude bericht hadden gesloten.</span></p></div></div></article><article class="llbh-art" id="h-track"><header class="llbh-art-h"><div class="llbh-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 20V10M10 20V4M16 20v-7M22 20H2"/></svg></div><div class="llbh-art-t"><h2><span data-lang="en">Tracking</span><span data-lang="nl">Tracking</span></h2><p><span data-lang="en">A place for extra third-party code, such as a marketing pixel. Every snippet only runs after the visitor accepted cookies.</span><span data-lang="nl">Een plek voor extra code van derden, zoals een marketingpixel. Elk stukje code werkt pas nadat de bezoeker cookies heeft geaccepteerd.</span></p></div><a class="llbh-open" href="<?php echo esc_url( admin_url( 'admin.php?page=llb-theme-options#track' ) ); ?>"><span data-lang="en">Open in Theme Options</span><span data-lang="nl">Openen in Theme Options</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></header><div class="llbh-art-b"><figure class="llbh-shot"><a href="<?php echo esc_url( llb_asset( 'images/help/help-track.webp' ) ); ?>" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( llb_asset( 'images/help/help-track.webp' ) ); ?>" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><figcaption><span data-lang="en">Screenshot — click to enlarge</span><span data-lang="nl">Schermafbeelding — klik om te vergroten</span></figcaption></figure><h3><span data-lang="en">What each setting does</span><span data-lang="nl">Wat elke instelling doet</span></h3><dl class="llbh-set"><div><dt>In &lt;head&gt; / After &lt;body&gt; / Before &lt;/body&gt;</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">Three places in the page. The provider of the code tells you where to paste it.</span><span data-lang="nl">Drie plekken in de pagina. De aanbieder van de code vertelt u waar u die moet plakken.</span></dd></div><div><dt>Consent category</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">Choose the cookie category of each snippet: <b>Functional</b>, <b>Preferences</b>, <b>Statistics</b> or <b>Marketing</b>. The code only runs when the visitor accepted that category.</span><span data-lang="nl">Kies de cookiecategorie van elk stukje code: <b>Functioneel</b>, <b>Voorkeuren</b>, <b>Statistieken</b> of <b>Marketing</b>. De code werkt alleen als de bezoeker die categorie heeft geaccepteerd.</span></dd></div></dl><h3><span data-lang="en">How to use it</span><span data-lang="nl">Zo gebruikt u het</span></h3><ol class="llbh-steps" data-lang="en"><li>Install a cookie plugin first (for example <b>Complianz</b>).</li><li>Go to <b>Theme Options → Tracking</b>.</li><li>Paste the code in the right place and choose its category.</li><li>Click <b>Save changes</b>.</li></ol><ol class="llbh-steps" data-lang="nl"><li>Installeer eerst een cookieplugin (bijvoorbeeld <b>Complianz</b>).</li><li>Ga naar <b>Theme Options → Tracking</b>.</li><li>Plak de code op de juiste plek en kies de categorie.</li><li>Klik op <b>Save changes</b>.</li></ol><div class="llbh-note llbh-note--warn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.3 3.9 1.8 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h17a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0z"/><path d="M12 9v4M12 17h.01"/></svg><p><span data-lang="en">Without a cookie consent plugin, the snippets are <b>never</b> printed. This protects you under privacy law (GDPR).</span><span data-lang="nl">Zonder cookieplugin wordt de code <b>nooit</b> geplaatst. Zo voldoet u aan de privacywet (AVG).</span></p></div><div class="llbh-note llbh-note--info"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg><p><span data-lang="en">Google Analytics and Search Console are managed in <b>Site Kit by Google</b> — do not add them here.</span><span data-lang="nl">Google Analytics en Search Console beheert u in <b>Site Kit by Google</b> — voeg ze hier niet toe.</span></p></div></div></article><article class="llbh-art" id="h-brand"><header class="llbh-art-h"><div class="llbh-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 3l3 3-9 9-3-3zM9 12l-4 4a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 0 4c-1.5 0-3 .5-3 .5S2.5 17 4 16"/></svg></div><div class="llbh-art-t"><h2><span data-lang="en">Branding</span><span data-lang="nl">Huisstijl</span></h2><p><span data-lang="en">The look of the dashboard and the login screen.</span><span data-lang="nl">De uitstraling van het dashboard en het inlogscherm.</span></p></div><a class="llbh-open" href="<?php echo esc_url( admin_url( 'admin.php?page=llb-theme-options#brand' ) ); ?>"><span data-lang="en">Open in Theme Options</span><span data-lang="nl">Openen in Theme Options</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></header><div class="llbh-art-b"><figure class="llbh-shot"><a href="<?php echo esc_url( llb_asset( 'images/help/help-brand.webp' ) ); ?>" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( llb_asset( 'images/help/help-brand.webp' ) ); ?>" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><figcaption><span data-lang="en">Screenshot — click to enlarge</span><span data-lang="nl">Schermafbeelding — klik om te vergroten</span></figcaption></figure><h3><span data-lang="en">What each setting does</span><span data-lang="nl">Wat elke instelling doet</span></h3><dl class="llbh-set"><div><dt>Dashboard footer text</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">A short text at the bottom of every dashboard screen, for example the company name.</span><span data-lang="nl">Een korte tekst onderaan elk dashboardscherm, bijvoorbeeld de bedrijfsnaam.</span></dd></div><div><dt>Login screen</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">The login screen always uses the company logo and colors. Click <b>Preview login screen</b> to see it.</span><span data-lang="nl">Het inlogscherm gebruikt altijd het logo en de kleuren van het bedrijf. Klik op <b>Preview login screen</b> om het te bekijken.</span></dd></div></dl><h3><span data-lang="en">How to use it</span><span data-lang="nl">Zo gebruikt u het</span></h3><ol class="llbh-steps" data-lang="en"><li>Go to <b>Theme Options → Branding</b>.</li><li>Change the footer text.</li><li>Click <b>Save changes</b>.</li></ol><ol class="llbh-steps" data-lang="nl"><li>Ga naar <b>Theme Options → Branding</b>.</li><li>Wijzig de footertekst.</li><li>Klik op <b>Save changes</b>.</li></ol></div></article><article class="llbh-art" id="h-import"><header class="llbh-art-h"><div class="llbh-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v12M7 10l5 5 5-5M4 21h16"/></svg></div><div class="llbh-art-t"><h2><span data-lang="en">Import content</span><span data-lang="nl">Inhoud importeren</span></h2><p><span data-lang="en">Creates the standard pages, services, FAQ and menus with the default content in one click.</span><span data-lang="nl">Maakt met één klik de standaardpagina’s, diensten, veelgestelde vragen en menu’s aan met de standaardinhoud.</span></p></div><a class="llbh-open" href="<?php echo esc_url( admin_url( 'admin.php?page=llb-theme-options#import' ) ); ?>"><span data-lang="en">Open in Theme Options</span><span data-lang="nl">Openen in Theme Options</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></header><div class="llbh-art-b"><figure class="llbh-shot"><a href="<?php echo esc_url( llb_asset( 'images/help/help-import.webp' ) ); ?>" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( llb_asset( 'images/help/help-import.webp' ) ); ?>" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><figcaption><span data-lang="en">Screenshot — click to enlarge</span><span data-lang="nl">Schermafbeelding — klik om te vergroten</span></figcaption></figure><h3><span data-lang="en">What each setting does</span><span data-lang="nl">Wat elke instelling doet</span></h3><dl class="llbh-set"><div><dt>Import default content</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">Creates everything that is missing. Items that already exist are <b>skipped — nothing is overwritten</b>. It also sets the homepage and the privacy page when those are not set yet.</span><span data-lang="nl">Maakt alles aan wat nog ontbreekt. Wat al bestaat, wordt <b>overgeslagen — er wordt niets overschreven</b>. Ook worden de homepage en de privacypagina ingesteld als die nog niet zijn ingesteld.</span></dd></div><div><dt>Result</dt><dd><span data-lang="en">After the import you see a list: <b>Created</b> and <b>Skipped</b>.</span><span data-lang="nl">Na het importeren ziet u een lijst: <b>Created</b> (aangemaakt) en <b>Skipped</b> (overgeslagen).</span></dd></div></dl><h3><span data-lang="en">How to use it</span><span data-lang="nl">Zo gebruikt u het</span></h3><ol class="llbh-steps" data-lang="en"><li>Go to <b>Theme Options → Import content</b>.</li><li>Click <b>Import default content</b>.</li><li>Check the result list and the website.</li></ol><ol class="llbh-steps" data-lang="nl"><li>Ga naar <b>Theme Options → Import content</b>.</li><li>Klik op <b>Import default content</b>.</li><li>Controleer de resultatenlijst en de website.</li></ol><div class="llbh-note llbh-note--info"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg><p><span data-lang="en">Use it on a new installation, or to bring back a page you deleted by accident. Safe to run again at any time.</span><span data-lang="nl">Gebruik het bij een nieuwe installatie, of om een per ongeluk verwijderde pagina terug te zetten. U kunt het altijd opnieuw uitvoeren.</span></p></div><div class="llbh-note llbh-note--info"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg><p><span data-lang="en">Set <b>Settings → Permalinks</b> to <b>Post name</b> once, so all page links work.</span><span data-lang="nl">Zet <b>Instellingen → Permalinks</b> eenmalig op <b>Berichtnaam</b>, zodat alle paginalinks werken.</span></p></div></div></article>
